:: Poppy Valentine Flat Arrival
<<set $valentines_poppy_flat_accept to undefined>>
You arrive at the flats.
<br><br>
You stand in front of Poppy's door for a moment to take a deep breath, readying yourself before knocking. When the door opens, Poppy greets you before the smell of food hits.
<br>
<<Hes>> 
<<if C.npc.Poppy.gender is "m">>>>
	wearing dark trousers and a fitted vest, <<his>> rustic red jacket the only colour highlighting the outfit.
<<else>>
	wearing a deep red gown that hugged <<his>> waist and hips, lace slipping from <<his>> shoulders as if <<he>>'d meant for it to be noticed.
<</if>>
<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
"My oh my! You look phenomenal, my jewel." Poppy gushes over your attire. "I just took out the main dish so it needs to cool a little. We can start on the appetizers though." <<He>> says as <<he>> ushers you in. 
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Poppy Valentine Flat Dinner]]>><</link>>

:: Poppy Valentine Flat Dinner
<<set $location to "flats">><<set $bus to "poppy_kitchen">><<set $outside to 0>>
The room is dim save for small specks of light that you realize are from small candles scattered throughout the room. You barely have a moment to admire it before Poppy pulls out a seat for you. 
<br><br>
"Now sit here and be good for me, alright? I'll be back in just a minute." You sit down and watch as <<he>> enters the kitchen. Not a moment later, Poppy brings out courses of succulent looking food. 
<br><br>
You both enjoy the meal, with the star being the salmon wellington Poppy cooked. You're not sure how <<he>> did it, but it somehow even tastes better than you expected. <<stress -3>><<trauma -3>><<llstress>><<ltrauma>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Poppy Valentine Flat Dinner 2]]>><<pass 60>><</link>>

:: Poppy Valentine Flat Dinner 2
<<effects>>
Once dinner is finished, Poppy dabs <<his>> mouth with a napkin and slowly gets up. You see <<him>> walk over to a small table which holds an old vinyl record player. Soft, classical music begins to play. Poppy starts humming along, twirling in place before looking your way. "A romantic date must end with a dance now, mustn't it?" <<He>> extends a hand out to you. 
<br><br>
The way Poppy looks at you makes your body move on its own to take Poppy's hand. The music continues to play as the two of you waltz together. 
<<silently>><<dancedifficulty 1 600>><</silently>>
<<if $danceSuccess>>
	<<if currentSkillValue('danceskill') gte 1000>>
		<span class ="green">You're excellent at this </span>
	<<elseif currentSkillValue('danceskill') gte 600>>
		You move confidently 
	<<elseif currentSkillValue('danceskill') gte 400>>
		You are good at this 
	<<elseif currentSkillValue('danceskill') gte 100>>
		You manage to follow the music without problem 
	<<else>>
		You manage to not stumble 
	<</if>>
	and the two of you fall into rhythm, moving together seamlessly without thinking. <<danceskilluse>>
	<<poppyOpiumPulse>>
<<else>>
	You stumble but Poppy catches you swiftly. 
	
	<<poppyOpiumPulse>> 
	
	The two of you continue to dance as if nothing had happened.
<</if>>
<<if $bodysize gte 3>>
	You feel Poppy lay <<his>> head against your chest, still humming along with the song as it slowly comes to an end.
<<else>>
	You feel Poppy rest <<his>> chin on top of your head, still humming along with the song as it slowly comes to an end.
<</if>>
<br><br>
"...Hey." Poppy murmured softly, <<his>> voice only slightly louder than the music. "You know...there were days when I questioned the choices I made. The things I did, sometimes I wonder if any of this was worth it." You see Poppy look at you with a smile, but not <<his>> usual coy or mischievous one. It's a subtle smile, one that shows how truly comfortable <<he>> is with you. "Then I met you. And now I know everything was worth it just to be here with you."
<br><br>
<<link [[Kiss Poppy|Poppy Valentine Flat Dinner Kiss]]>><<npcincr Poppy love 1>><<npcincr Poppy lust 1>><</link>><<gglove>><<glust>><<kissvirginitywarning>><br>
